<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Volkswagen is Merrill focus.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Volkswagen is Merrill focus.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Merrill Lynch said it named Volkswagen AG as its Global Focus One stock.</p>
<p>-- The brokerage said it maintained its near-term buy rating and long-term accumulate rating on the German automaker.</p>
</text>
